Read-only context on how EMBED data represents clinical meaning, as a graph of linked documents.

How to use it
- {{ command("search") }} takes a clinical question or term and returns compact results.
- {{ command("read") }} takes an ID and returns that document with its links in both directions. Linked documents appear by ID and label, never in full; read a linked ID to follow the link.
- {{ command("code") }} explains a represented value through the code lists, column interpretations, and missing states that apply.
- Output is text. Pass {{ arg("read", "format") }} json for the same facts as JSON.

